    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4c1fceb5f34b3b854e2c06d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "抵达终点！稻荷一在大井选拔赛以4身距大获全胜！\n那娇小身躯中满溢着力量，跑得太完美了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b180fab9d8f4809eb81cbd61b4bf12b3900fcfc11efbd2ad16f2145ad5417b04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1034/storytimeline_041034001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c43d51fe33da7a34d235eb20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "忍不住呼出的一口气，是我看得忘了呼吸的证据。\n……刚才目睹的精彩表现就是如此吸引着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dae9b5dafa2691502e1df4a9f6cd436cdba756983db724648de4258dd562400b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1034/storytimeline_041034001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f05d1a7d8b7bee268465bb9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的心脏剧烈跳动。那撼动大地般的强力跑法。\n宛如火花般的激烈斗志。在沙土上仍如此耀眼的速度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2babd3dfe3090a8e7beab2cdea01f80258c77bfd2832418b5965461b07aa7e42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1034/storytimeline_041034001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
