      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在草地赛道──闪耀系列赛上一定也能有好表现。\n只有她了……就是她了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "029695dab7aeb6839a93fd7ff6b61a7a93ec2498a093a027282ab8eb3c6e3792",
